This recommendation is based on the focus on storage flexibility for the microwave. The Breville Compact Wave Soft Close offers a compact size (25L) and includes a soft-close door, one-touch buttons, and food menu shortcuts. The Toshiba microwave features a sleek design with a digital display, while the Sharp SMC1452CH offers a larger capacity of 1.4 cu. ft. and 1100 watts of power.

The LG NeoChef™ 2.0 cu. ft. Countertop Microwave is also included due to its large capacity of 2.0 cu. ft. and Smart Inverter tech for even heating. The last three products are included as they have a more conventional design with storage flexibility options, such as the 1.2 cu. ft., 900-watt microwave with a Black Stainless Steel finish and the Galanz Retro Microwave, which offers multiple color options. Finally, the GE HMC920BEWW is included due to its smart features and compact size but it may not be the best option for users prioritizing storage flexibility.
